    },
    {
      "name": "protection_plans",
      "description": "List protection plan providers for a single appliance or for a whole home in the United States or the United Kingdom, with each provider's own public rating and how it is regulated. Nothing is ranked or recommended. Use it when someone asks who sells appliance or home protection plans.",
